   "subject": "About extraction of P-value of KS test in gof_ds function",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all,<div>        I want only p-value of KS test in gof_ds function.</div><div>my output is,</div><div><div>&gt; gof_ds(hn,ks=TRUE)</div><div><br></div><div>Goodness of fit results for ddf object</div><div><br></div><div>Distance sampling Kolmogorov-Smirnov test</div><div>Test statistic = 0.030477 p-value = 0.76</div><div> (p-value calculated from 100/100 bootstraps)</div><div>Distance sampling Cramer-von Mises test (unweighted)</div><div>Test statistic = 0.039998 p-value = 0.933159</div></div><div><br></div><div>In this case I want only 0.76 and 0.933. How would it extracted???</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "NczH0LwEBQAJ",
   "from": "Eric Rexstad",
   "author": "f2122b34f1aa6e95",
   "date": "2019-09-21T18:06:56Z",
   "subject": "{Disarmed} Re: [distance-sampling] About extraction of P-value of KS test in gof_ds function",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Gajanan</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>Have a look at the structure of the object created by the function <code>gof_ds()</code> The code below will do what you want:</div>\r\n<code>\r\n<pre style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.05);padding:0.2em 1em\">library(Distance)\r\n<br>data(minke)\r\n<br><a href=\"http://minke.hn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://minke.hn&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792473884400000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2V3rEAClJqOXv_V8e2L6u-\">minke.hn</a> &lt;- ds(minke, key=&quot;hn&quot;)\r\n<br>fit.stats &lt;- gof_ds(<a href=\"http://minke.hn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://minke.hn&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792473884400000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2V3rEAClJqOXv_V8e2L6u-\">minke.hn</a>, ks=TRUE)\r\n<br>str(fit.stats)\r\n<br>ks.p &lt;- fit.stats$dsgof$ks$p\r\n<br>cvm.p &lt;- fit.stats$dsgof$CvM$p\r\n<br>print(c(ks.p, cvm.p))\r\n</pre>\r\n</code><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<div><u></u>\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top\"></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<div>Eric Rexstad</div>\r\n<div>Senior Research Fellow, CREEM, Univ. of St Andrews, Charity SC013532</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:0.9em;border-top:1px solid gray;min-width:250px;max-width:300px;margin-top:4px;padding-top:4px\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/782...@getmailspring.com/0?redirect=mai...%40st-andrews.ac.uk&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/782...@getmailspring.com/0?redirect%3Dmailto%253Aeric.rexstad%2540st-andrews.ac.uk%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792473884400000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2pTRYF7Vk48aA13bAMCDT-\">eric.r...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"margin-right:8px\"><a href=\"tel:+44%20(0)1334%20461833\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)1334 461833</a></span></div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/782...@getmailspring.com/1?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmaps.google.com%2F%3Fq%3DThe%2520Observatory%252C%2520Buchanan%2520Gardens%252C%2520St%2520Andrews%2520KY16%25209LZ&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/782...@getmailspring.com/1?redirect%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmaps.google.com%252F%253Fq%253DThe%252520Observatory%25252C%252520Buchanan%252520Gardens%25252C%252520St%252520Andrews%252520KY16%2525209LZ%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792473884400000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1H2MVdpVYSzB9Yc8E8UZ6I\">The\r\n Observatory, Buchanan Gardens, St Andrews KY16 9LZ</a></div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/782...@getmailspring.com/2?redirect=http%3A%2F%2Ferex.github.io&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/782...@getmailspring.com/2?redirect%3Dhttp%253A%252F%252Ferex.github.io%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792473884400000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1N8iDgjZogyCFV34Qrrpbs\"><font color=\"red\"><b>MailScanner has detected a possible fraud attempt from &quot;link.getmailspring.com&quot; claiming to be</b></font> http://erex.github.io</a></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<u></u></div></div>"
